ded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s11" target="s14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="s23" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Every transition writes an AuditRecord through AuditLog.record().&lt;br&gt;• DailyReport starts in Draft (createReport() from a ReportTemplate).&lt;br&gt;• MonthlySummaryReport is created by SummaryGenerator at month end&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;and submitted automatically.&lt;br&gt;• Only a Submitted report can be reviewed (canBeReviewed())." style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="560" width="460" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>